[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251546649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110239#issuecomment-3251546649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110239","id":3251546649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BzqoZ","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T02:43:27Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T02:55:57Z","body":"Is there really a problem with `0.5`; won't both branches simplify to `color` as `(2.0f * glow.r - 1.0f)` becomes `0`?\r\n\r\nOtherwise the function looks _correct_ but the form is a bit odd. Personally I'd move to use the [more widely known version](https://www.w3.org/TR/compositing-1/#blendingsoftlight) (unless there's a precision benefit or smth that I'm unaware of) for the left side:\r\n```hlsl\r\n(color.r + (2.0f * glow.r - 1.0f) * (((16.0f * color.r - 12.0f) * color.r + 4.0f) * color.r - color.r))\r\n```\r\nIf you want to be space efficient combine the common parts and place the condition in the middle:\r\n```hlsl\r\n(color.r + (2.0f * glow.r - 1.0f) * ((color.r <= 0.25f ? ((16.0f * color.r - 12.0f) * color.r + 4.0f) * color.r : sqrt(color.r)) - color.r))\r\n```\r\n\r\nEDIT: Concentrated on the functions at first but if you want to simplify further:\r\n```hlsl\r\nglow = glow * vec3(0.5f) + vec3(0.5f);\r\n(2.0f * glow.r - 1.0f);\r\n```\r\nthese lines are inverse of one another, so the combined function (the short version for example) could become:\r\n```hlsl\r\n(color.r + glow.r * ((color.r <= 0.25f ? ((16.0f * color.r - 12.0f) * color.r + 4.0f) * color.r : sqrt(color.r)) - color.r))\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251546649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251582789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110239#issuecomment-3251582789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110239","id":3251582789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BzzdF","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T02:57:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T02:57:09Z","body":"> Is there really a problem with `0.5`; won't both branches simplify to `color` as `(2.0f * glow.r - 1.0f)` becomes `0`?\n\nAh, I think you're right; I had just seen (0,undefined) in the graphing calculator and blindly trusted it instead of checking the math myself.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251582789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251672752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110239#issuecomment-3251672752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110239","id":3251672752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7B0Jaw","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T03:31:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T03:31:18Z","body":"Let's look at the case where glow.r is < 0.5.\r\n\r\nAssume `glow.r = 0.4` and `color.r = 0.8`\r\n\r\n**Before:**\r\n`(color.r - (1.0f - 2.0f * glow.r) * color.r * (1.0f - color.r))`\r\n`result = (0.8 - (1.0f - 2.0f * 0.4) * 0.8 * (1.0f - 0.8))`\r\n`result = (0.8 - (0.2) * 0.8 * (0.2))`\r\n`result = 0.768`\r\n\r\n**After**\r\n`result = 0.8`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251672752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251767933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110239#issuecomment-3251767933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110239","id":3251767933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7B0gp9","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T04:16:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T04:19:39Z","body":"> Let's look at the case where glow.r is < 0.5.\r\n> \r\n> Assume `glow.r = 0.4` and `color.r = 0.8`\r\n> \r\n> **Before:** `(color.r - (1.0f - 2.0f * glow.r) * color.r * (1.0f - color.r))` `result = (0.8 - (1.0f - 2.0f * 0.4) * 0.8 * (1.0f - 0.8))` `result = (0.8 - (0.2) * 0.8 * (0.2))` `result = 0.768`\r\n> \r\n> **After** `result = 0.8`\r\n\r\nGlow can never be below 0.5 as it is first clamped to 0 to 1 range and then 0.5 is added. The path for below 0.5 is completely unnecessary as we only want to use the part of soft-light blending that lightens (i.e > 0.5 range).\r\n\r\nEdit: For further clarity: even in your example it doesn't make sense that glow 0.4 + color 0.8 would result in darker color (0.768) i.e. negative glow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251767933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3251874753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110239#issuecomment-3251874753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110239","id":3251874753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7B06vB","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events