r\n> (color.r + glow.r * ((color.r <= 0.25f ? ((16.0f * color.r - 12.0f) * color.r + 4.0f) * color.r : sqrt(color.r)) - color.r))\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nWow, I didn't intend to nerd-snipe like this, but this [new function](https://www.desmos.com/calculator/z625dvwxoq) looks great to me! I've pushed the changes to this PR with you as co-author.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3254561304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352444655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110239#issuecomment-3352444655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110239","id":3352444655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H0j7v","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T14:21:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T14:21:09Z","body":"I've included the changes from this PR in #110671 and added co-authors to 